# Link Task Sheet

::summary
The app-detail Link Task sheet (detail section 7): workspace task rows; already-linked rows render checked and inert; a tap links and the sheet STAYS UP for multi-link — Done closes it.
::

::modal[name=link-task title="Link Task" width=340 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::toolbar
- spacer
- button[label="Done" action=dismissLinkTask]
:::

:::row[icon=task state=linked href=#]
Play Store Surfspace setup — TWA lane
Build · already linked — checked + inert
:::

:::row[icon=task action=linkTaskToApp href=#]
Verify DMARC policy
To Do · tap to link — the sheet stays up for multi-link
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon (Done and ✕ both close; ✕ is never the only exit). Linked tasks appear in the detail's Tasks section with the trailing Unlink action.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
